<title>USA: Central U.S. carlot pork at 1500 CST - USDA.</title>
<headline>Central U.S. carlot pork at 1500 CST - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fresh loins mostly $2.00 lower; butts steady; sknd. hams 17-20 lbs. steady to $3.00 lower, 20-26 lbs. steady; sdls. bellies $2.00-3.00 lower; lean trimmings steady.</p>
<p>Trading slow to moderate, with light demand and mostly moderate offerings. -USDA</p>
